      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.9,
      "end_seconds": 250.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.12,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I swim twice a week. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
