      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.86,
      "end_seconds": 313.1,
      "duration_seconds": 26.24,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review, and we'll know more once the an urgent surgical review is back let's book an urgent surgical review to look into possible necrotising infection i am sending you to hospital now, do not wait"
    },
