      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.6,
      "end_seconds": 328.12,
      "duration_seconds": 14.52,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Please don't wait if you cannot go now. That's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
